Q: QGroupBox border A: <p>To achieve exactly the desired result, you need to do the following:</p>
<pre><code>QGroupBox {
    border: 1px solid gray;
    margin-top: 12px;
}

QGroupBox::title {
    subcontrol-origin: margin;
    subcontrol-position: top left;
    left: 10px;
    top: 3px;
}
</code></pre>
<p>Example of 2 styles: <a href="https://i.sstatic.net/KPFkgATG.png" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://i.sstatic.net/KPFkgATG.png</a></p>
